a('Detail','Cause and effect','easy','Why do the covered areas of the cloth keep their original color?',['Because the cloth is washed first','Because the wax resists the dye','Because artisans paint them white','Because UNESCO requires it','Because the dye is too weak'],'B','Kalimat kedua: wax resists the dye, sehingga bagian tertutup tetap berwarna asli.','Cari kata sebab (because/so) pada teks.',45,passage=E3)
a('Vocabulary in context','Phrasal verb in context','medium','The phrase "build up" in the passage is closest in meaning to...',['destroy','gradually create','quickly sell','carefully hide','finally remove'],'B','Mengulang proses beberapa kali untuk "membangun" desain rumit sedikit demi sedikit.','Perhatikan kata "repeat several times" sebagai petunjuk.',45,passage=E3)
a('Text structure','Organization','medium','How is the passage organized?',['Problem then solution','A description of a process followed by a note on recognition','A debate between two opinions','A list of unrelated facts','A timeline from 1900 to today'],'B','Dua kalimat pertama menjelaskan proses; kalimat terakhir menyebut pengakuan UNESCO tahun 2009.','Lihat peran tiap kalimat: proses → hasil → pengakuan.',60,passage=E3)

